abstract: >-
  Governance-Driven Agentic Coding is a governance harness and evaluation
  protocol for bounded software work delegated to AI coding agents. It defines
  outcomes and authority before execution, binds evaluation evidence to an
  exact candidate, and reserves final acceptance for an accountable human
  Owner.
